# Canonical text policy: LF in the working tree and in the index, so a clean clone compiles to
# the same binary as the published tree. Visual Studio solution files and Windows batch files keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sln text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.dmp binary
